<view class="container">
  <view class="kicker">思维闯关 · 07</view>
  <view class="title">24点</view>
  <view class="subtitle">四个数各用一次，只允许 + − × ÷ 和括号，结果必须正好是 24。有些牌必须经过分数——只肯用整数就走不通。</view>

  <view class="status">{{status}}</view>

  <view class="cards">
    <view class="card {{selected.indexOf(item.id) >= 0 ? 'selected' : ''}}" wx:for="{{cards}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="tapCard">
      <text class="num">{{item.value.n}}</text>
      <text wx:if="{{item.value.d !== 1}}" class="den">/{{item.value.d}}</text>
      <text class="expr">{{item.expr}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="ops">
    <view class="op" wx:for="{{ops}}" wx:key="index" data-op="{{item}}" bindtap="applyOp">{{item}}</view>
  </view>

  <view class="actions">
    <view class="btn-ghost" bindtap="showHint">提示</view>
    <view class="btn-primary" bindtap="newPuzzle">换一题</view>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{hint}}" class="hint">{{hint}}</view>

  <view class="rule">
    <view class="rule-title">为什么有些牌必须用分数</view>
    <view class="rule-text">例如 3、3、8、8：8 ÷ (3 − 8 ÷ 3) = 24。只允许整数四则运算，就永远凑不出来。</view>
  </view>
</view>
